      },
      "message": "fix(geometry): add bounded ASCII DXF reader\n\nParse explicit units, layers and exact planar DXF primitives.\nRefuse malformed, unsupported and oversized input by name.\nPin parsing, refusal and mutation behavior in the geometry crate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>\n\nFixes #1860",
