      },
      "message": "fix(geometry): refuse bulge arcs that lose endpoints\n\nValidate both reconstructed arc endpoints against the source chord.\nPin clockwise and counterclockwise refusals in both polyline formats.\nKeep ordinary small bulge arcs covered by endpoint assertions.\n\nFixes #1860",
